[2026-01-30T15:09:15.377Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_0138nrkpvaw8Nqjh3WBkuztK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the implementation. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Summary\n\n### 1. Created Declarative Report Builder Classes in `actor/src/templates/base.py`:\n\n- **`MarkdownBuilder`** - Utility class with static methods for common markdown patterns:\n  - `header()` - Generate headers at any level\n  - `metadata()` - Bold label with value\n  - `bullet()` - Bullet points with optional prefix\n  - `divider()` - Horizontal rule\n  - `table()` - Full markdown table generation\n  - `format_extracted_field()` - Format extracted data fields\n\n- **`SectionSpec`** - Declarative specification for a report section:\n  - `title`, `finding_types`, `max_items`, `show_if_empty`\n  - `render_style` - \"bullet\", \"detailed\", \"table\", or \"custom\"\n  - `prefix_field` / `prefix_transform` - Add severity prefixes like [HIGH]\n  - `extracted_fields` / `extracted_format` - Show structured data\n  - `custom_filter` / `custom_renderer` - Allow template-specific overrides\n\n- **`AssessmentSpec`** - Specification for risk/verdict assessment sections:\n  - Configurable thresholds and labels\n  - Automatic risk level calculation from findings\n\n- **`ReportVariantSpec`** - Complete report variant definition:\n  - Title template, metadata, dividers\n  - List of `SectionSpec` sections\n  - Optional assessment section\n  - Perspective warnings/recommendations\n\n- **`ReportBuilder`** - Main class that renders reports from specifications:\n  - Takes result dict and optional template reference\n  - `render()` method generates complete markdown from spec\n  - Supports bullet lists, detailed views, and tables\n  - Handles extracted_data formatting with prefixes\n\n### 2. Migrated `actor/src/templates/due_diligence.py`:\n\n**Before (61 lines of imperative code):**\n```python\ndef generate_risk_summary(self, result, title):\n    query = result.get(\"query\", \"Unknown\")\n    report_title = title or f\"Due Diligence: {query[:50]}\"\n    sections = []\n    sections.append(f\"# {report_title}\")\n    # ... 50+ more lines of manual formatting\n```\n\n**After (12 lines of declarative + 3 lines method):**\n```python\nRISK_SUMMARY_SPEC = ReportVariantSpec(\n    variant_name=\"risk_summary\",\n    title_template=\"Due Diligence: {query}\",\n    assessment_section=AssessmentSpec(finding_type=\"red_flag\", ...),\n    sections=[\n        SectionSpec(title=\"Red Flags\", finding_types=[\"red_flag\"], prefix_field=\"severity\"),\n        SectionSpec(title=\"Legal History\", finding_types=[\"legal_history\"]),\n        SectionSpec(title=\"Reputation Signals\", finding_types=[\"reputation_signal\"]),\n    ],\n)\n\ndef generate_risk_summary(self, result, title):\n    builder = ReportBuilder(result, self)\n    return builder.render(RISK_SUMMARY_SPEC, title)\n```\n\n### 3. Code Reduction:\n- The `generate_risk_summary` method went from ~61 lines to ~15 lines (75% reduction)\n- New report variants can be added with ~10-15 lines of declarative config instead of ~100 lines\n- Bug fixes and improvements to rendering now apply to all templates automatically\n\n### 4. Updated exports in `actor/src/templates/__init__.py`:\n- Added exports for `ReportBuilder`, `ReportVariantSpec`, `SectionSpec`, `AssessmentSpec`, `MarkdownBuilder`\n\nAll Python files pass syntax validation."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_read_input_tokens":147125,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"26af0bba-dbf1-4324-9c96-beb1a411d4bb"}
